    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know about \"strength.\" it just feels like i'm a carrier. like i'm the vessel for all this rot and it's just gonna pass to the next person no matter what i do. maybe the only way to actually stop the damage is to just make sure there's no one left to pass it to. does that even make sense?",
